# Argot's fitted snapshot is reviewed and committed with this repository.
# `argot fit` refreshes it locally; CI only consumes it.
# Everything else below is runtime/cache state and stays local.
*
!.gitignore
!generic-baseline.json
!scorer-config.json
!semantic-index.json
!layering.json
!integrity.json
!health.json
!manifest.json
!rules/
!rules/**
